# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for the phd-thesis GitHub upload.
#
# Goal: publish SOURCE (R/Python/Slurm), CONFIG (yaml/Config), the THESIS
# (LaTeX + figures), and the small CURATED result files that reproduce the
# thesis tables/figures. EXCLUDE ~1.3 TB of raw data and simulation output,
# and ALL raw clinical data (VCCC / Waitemata DHB) regardless of location.
#
# Data formats are ignored globally; only specific curated files are added
# back at the bottom. A blanket "!results_*" is deliberately NOT used, since
# it would re-include large raw results_*.RData.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Raw data, simulation output, model checkpoints (the bulk) ----
*.parquet
*.RData
*.rda
*.rds
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.feather
*.arrow
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.pk
*.joblib
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.sav
*.dta
*.sas7bdat

# ---- Archives ----
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar

# ---- Editor / tooling / OS / build cruft ----
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
*.out
*.tmp
*.bak
*.iml
*.xml
*.DS_Store
*.Rhistory
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.Rproj.user/
.claude/
.agents/
my_venv/
.venv/
venv/
save/

# =====================================================================
# Re-include CURATED result files (small; feed the thesis tables/figures)
# =====================================================================
!Summary_Table.csv
!results_COMBINED.csv
!results_TIMES.csv
!results_*_SUMMARY.csv
!results_*_BY_COVARIATE.csv
!results_combined_first50.csv
!results_dualboot.csv
!results_dualsandwich.csv
!results_modelbased.csv

# ---- Re-include reproducibility seeds / parameters (small config-like data) ----
!covarInfo.RData
!data_generation_seed.RData
!data_sampling_seed.RData
!genoCorr.RData
!genoFreq.RData
!genoTrait.RData
!labtest_parameters.RData
!mixgb_balanceParams.RData
!mixgb_neymanParams.RData
!mixgb_srsParams.RData
